                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "I built a cross-platform application that manages users, reads event logs and opens doors remotely, together with the services that talk to the devices. Device-protocol communication, three microservices and user-photo transfer kept terminals and the central database in sync, while unit tests and CI/CD pipelines made every release safer and faster.",
